      "content": "hey so i was just sitting on my couch watching tv and suddenly i saw like a bunch of tiny dark spots floating in my vision on the left side. and now it feels like there is a weird shadow or a curtain partially blocking my view. has this ever happened to u or do u know what it could be?? i'm kinda freaked out but i don't really want to go to the er if it's nothing",
